    "asks": "what kind of thing the question wants: constant, behaviour, error, api, structure",
    "wording": "named = the question uses a word that also appears in the text. paraphrase = it deliberately avoids them. NEITHER may contain the identifier it is looking for - that would measure string matching, not retrieval",
